"post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: <span class=\"bullet\">Read the paragraph.</span> <span class=\"bullet\">Type in the missing words. </span><span class=\"bullet\">Choose from these words: <span class=\"product-color-text\">contact information</span>, <span class=\"product-color-text\">positive</span>, <span class=\"product-color-text\">inside source</span>, <span class=\"product-color-text\">opportunity</span>. </span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": 2, "type": "template_override"}], "stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 2, "type": "TYP", "id": 9}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "RSLT", "id": 10}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn9le03ob06re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "responses": [{"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nFind out about more advantages of networking.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n", "type": "text"}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "DWS", "id": 11}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le03ob06re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le03ob06re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le03ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn9le03ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi's Mom</span>: Hello?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Hey Mom!\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi's Mom</span>: Hi Kristi. Were you trying to call me a while ago?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: No but I was thinking about what you were saying on my way home.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi's Mom</span>: Okay ..."}, {"time": "13000", "image": "engenn9le03ob06re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Now, I know it seems like I was dismissing this idea earlier when you mentioned it but I was hoping you could give me Danielle's contact information?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi's Mom</span>: Of course. I was wondering when you were going to ask.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: You know me too well! I was contemplating whether or not I'd ask. But, I think it might help to talk to someone in the media industry.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kristi's Mom</span>: It will, networking always helps. There are lots of advantages to networking, you know.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Are there? I was just looking at it as a way to make more contacts in the industry. You know, an opportunity to expand your network.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi's Mom</span>: There's that. One of the other benefits is that it is the most effective way to find jobs and there's less competition than your traditional job search.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: You do have a point there. Not everyone is willing to talk to any potential contact and sometimes you may be required to talk to numerous contacts before obtaining any kind of results."}, {"time": "76000", "image": "engenn9le03ob06re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi's Mom</span>: True. I think the biggest advantage is that you're learning so much. One of the perks is learning tips about company and hiring trends from inside sources. Another positive point is  the ability to access the hidden job market and find jobs that will not be advertised. A plus is the possibility of being referred to a company that only hires through referrals.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Going back to the topic, can you send me Danielle's e-mail?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi's Mom</span>: I'll send you a text with all her contact information. Danielle will most definitely be willing to offer her knowledge and advice to you.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Thanks, Mom! You're the best!  <br><br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Oh man, the idea of contacting a professional seems daunting \u2026  and there's Mom's text."}]}}], "id": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "The World of Work", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "An Option: Networking", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 3, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Identify and describe jobs and careers in both work and social contexts appropriate for the interlocutor.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Simple Past and The Past Continuous Tenses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you are talking on the phone,  it is common to use a mixture of tenses. The allows you to convey a variety of timelines and action sequences.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Past tense</span> to talk about many kinds of past events: short, quickly finished actions, longer situations and repeated events.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the<span class=\"strong\"> Past Continuous tense</span> to talk: <br>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<li> about<span class=\"strong\"> two </span> actions in the past; one continues for a period, and the other starts and ends (simple past). <br>For example: <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">While </span>I <span class=\"underline\">was walking</span> home, I <span class=\"underline\">thought </span>about what you said. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<li>about two actions in the past, both happening over a period.<br>For example:  <span class=\"italic\">I  <span class=\"underline\">was thinking</span> about what you <span class=\"underline\">were saying.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<li>about a temporary activity taking place over a limited time.<br>For example:<span class=\"italic\"> I <span class=\"underline\">was wondering </span>when you <span class=\"underline\">were going to</span> call.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The form of the <span class=\"strong\">Past Continuous</span> is: <br>subject + was/were + verb-ing", "type": "text"}, {"content": "NOTE: When you want to ask a question, using the <span class=\"strong\"> Past Continuous </span> the form changes. <br> <span class=\"italic\">Was/were + subject + verb-ing \u2026 ? <br>For example:  <br><span class=\"italic\">Were you trying to call me? <br>Was it raining outside?", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking about Advantages", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "An advantage is a good or useful quality or condition that something has. You often talk about the advantages of doing certain things when finding a job. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Here are some expressions you can use when talking about the advantages. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Using determiners\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Using collocations\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Using other words (instead of advantage)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><li>An/ The advantage<br><li> One of the advantages<br><li> Some advantages are\u2026/ Some of the advantages are\u2026\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><li>The greatest advantage/ The main advantage/ The most significant advantage<br><li> By far the most important advantage<br><li> A great/major/big advantage<br><li> A more important/very important advantage<br><li> A possible/potential advantage<br><li> Another advantage/ A further advantage/ An additional advantage/ One more advantage\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><li>benefit<br><li> pro<br><li> opportunity<br><li> perk<br><li> positive (point)<br><li> plus\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "A possible advantage is getting an interview.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Another benefit is meeting new people.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "One more perk is learning about the company.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "contact", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person you know who may be able to help or advise you", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I was just looking at it as a way to make more contacts.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about a step in the job search.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "contact information ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the details required to reach someone, such as an address or telephone number  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I was hoping you could give me Danielle's contact information.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "networking ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the practice of meeting other people involved in the same kind of work, to share information ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are lots of advantages to networking you know.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "industry ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "businesses that provide a particular service ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's a way to meet more contacts in the industry. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hiring trend ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a general tendency in the way people are employed  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You'll learn tips about company and hiring trends.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "inside source", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a person who is part of a particular company or industry that gives you information ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You'll learn about a variety of things from an inside source.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "job market ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " the people looking for work and the jobs that are available at that time ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  You also have the ability to access the hidden job market and find jobs that will not be advertised.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob06aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "referral ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who is recommended to someone  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You could even be referred to a company that only hires through referrals.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob06aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go on the internet. Do some research about the advantages of networking.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down 5-7 advantages. Which one do you think is most important? Least important? ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Organize your advantages in order of importance. Remember to use expressions to talk about the advantages.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share the advantages you wrote down with a partner. Do you have any in common?", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I identify the advantages of networking.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about professional information related to networking.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I organize my advantages in order of importance.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share and discuss my advantages with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}